camvistra (1.0.0.19-1~focal1) focal; urgency=medium
  * Package the CamVistra PyQt5 application (Source/CamVistraPy) instead of
    the C++/Qt application, from prebuilt files: debian/rules no longer
    compiles anything and only installs the files in Source/.
  * Install only what the application needs: the PyQt UI package (Linux
    modules, compiled QML resources, native extension) in
    /usr/lib/camvistra, the SDK libraries from
    Source/lib/<Ubuntu_version>/<arch> in /usr/lib, and the SDK interface
    headers (I*.h, with the export, enum and type headers they include)
    in /usr/include/camvistra.
  * Build-Depends: debhelper, dh-python, python3 and patchelf only.
  * Depends: replace the Qt/QML -dev packages with the PyQt5 bindings
    (QtQuick, QtWebEngine, QtChart), PyOpenGL, NumPy, psutil and the QML
    modules the shared view imports; drop mkvtoolnix, add iputils-ping.
  * Rename the package from truesight to camvistra: commands
    camvistra and camvistra-root-launcher, /usr/lib/camvistra,
    /usr/include/camvistra. Conflicts/Replaces truesight.

 -- CamVistra <TrueSight@e-consystems.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0530

camvistra (1.0.0.18-1) focal; urgency=medium
  * Fixed the UI bug for Wifi Camera, added comments and code cleaning.
  * See3CAM_24CUG integration, bug fixes for See3CAM_1318_TC, Modifications in the zoom handling and UI Layout changes.
  * Added support for See3CAM_1318_TC, Audio with video recording , Histogram and Zoom implementation. And preserved the desktop user's PulseAudio connection when launching CamVistra with sudo.
  * Bug fixes for Low cost Routecam_CU22.
  * Removed the value in the header label in the Camera controls, Implemented Flip control in e-CAM212_USB and Added Proper Implementation for fetching all the available fps in Ethernet cameras.
  * Low cost Routecam_CU22 integration and GStreamer implementation for e-CAM212_USB.
  * Bug fixes for DensiCAM and See3CAM_130E integration.
  * Bug fixes for e-CAM212_USB and See3CAM_CU58 integration.
  * Added support for DensiCAM and new control implementation for ShelfVista.
  * Bug fixes for e-CAM212_USB and cross-hair and grid implementation. Added support for See3CAM_130E and See3CAM_CU58.
  * Added new controls for ShelfVista cameras, added multi-format still capture in USB cameras.
  * Bug fixes for Routecam_Cu514, added manual ip connection for Routecam cameras.
  * Added support for HEVC and H264 streaming and recording in USB cameras. Added support for E-cam16_USB.
  * Added support for E-cam212_USb camera.
  * Added support for Routecam_cu514.
  * Added new controls for OEM variant of Wifi camera.
  * Added support for Ethernet camera.
  * Azure Configuration added.
  * Initial release

